# ─── local runtime data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# devlog.jsonl is the dev bridge's capture of the LIVE game session (server host,
# planet ids, coordinates). It must never be published.
devlog.jsonl

# ─── local tool / editor config ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/

# ─── local backups ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak-*
*.backup

# ─── third-party reference scripts (kept locally, NOT redistributed) ───────────
# Originals consulted while porting to OGame v13:
#   OGLight (MIT, © 2019 Oz)  ·  OGame-One (GPL-3.0)  ·  OGDark (OGLight fork)
# PrOGect is a derivative of OGLight and credits it in LICENSE + the script header,
# but there is no reason to vendor whole copies of other people's tools here —
# and mixing a GPL-3.0 script into an MIT repo would muddle the licensing.
OGLight*.user.js
oglight*.user.js
OGLight Settings - standalone.html
ogameone.user.js
ogdarkv13.user.js.backup
ogamediag.user.js
analize.txt

# ─── throwaway visual harnesses (regenerated on demand from the userscript) ────
*-mock/
settings-harness/ogl.css
settings-harness/polish.css
